Flea 0.4.2: use session icon-theme assets for native file marks

Reuse the existing Icons::session resolver and bounded full-colour raster helper.
Keep exact row icon names in Copy marks, with the original glyph/language logo
as fallback. Decode only on background workers and cache ready, pending and
missing rasters. Thumbnails retain priority; toolbar/action glyphs are unchanged.

Use the relocated g2 modules and retain 0.4.2's successful fallback-paint captures.
Carry themed names and built-in fallbacks across window sockets, not intern IDs.

